- Improve detection under difficult lighting conditions.

## 13. Conclusion

The Smart Document Scanner demonstrates how fundamental Computer Vision operations can be combined to solve a practical problem. Edge detection and contour analysis locate the document, while perspective transformation corrects its orientation. Adaptive thresholding then creates a cleaner scanned output.

